Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,520] | Elapsed:  14.83s | Words: 9  | Text: 窮人一定做不成自媒体
Segment #2   [00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:02,840] | Elapsed:  14.83s | Words: 4  | Text: 为什么他是窮人
Segment #3   [00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,780] | Elapsed:  14.83s | Words: 9  | Text: 是因为他过往的前半生
Segment #4   [00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:07,160] | Elapsed:  14.83s | Words: 11 | Text: 他一定是一个遇到问题就放弃的人
Segment #5   [00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:08,740] | Elapsed:  14.83s | Words: 8  | Text: 他一定是一个三天打鱼
Segment #6   [00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:09,640] | Elapsed:  14.83s | Words: 5  | Text: 两天身亡的人
Segment #7   [00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:10,980] | Elapsed:  14.83s | Words: 9  | Text: 他不然他不可能是窮人
Segment #8   [00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:12,540] | Elapsed:  14.83s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是做自媒体的是什么
Segment #9   [00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:14,280] | Elapsed:  14.83s | Words: 5  | Text: 是你要去忍受
Segment #10  [00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,160] | Elapsed:  14.83s | Words: 7  | Text: 常人所吃不了的苦
Segment #11  [00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:17,240] | Elapsed:  14.83s | Words: 5  | Text: 你要忍受孤独
Segment #12  [00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:18,520] | Elapsed:  14.83s | Words: 8  | Text: 你要忍受你去做一件事情
Segment #13  [00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,860] | Elapsed:  14.83s | Words: 9  | Text: 三个月两个月没有回报
Segment #14  [00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:23,380] | Elapsed:  14.83s | Words: 12 | Text: 并且你还能去坚持的去走完
Segment #15  [00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:24,320] | Elapsed:  14.83s | Words: 6  | Text: 一条孤独的路
Segment #16  [00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:25,380] | Elapsed:  14.83s | Words: 6  | Text: 那你要能完成这个点
Segment #17  [00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:26,520] | Elapsed:  14.83s | Words: 7  | Text: 你怎么可能是窮人呢
Segment #18  [00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:28,320] | Elapsed:  14.83s | Words: 9  | Text: 所以说很多人去做自媒体
Segment #19  [00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:31,160] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 12 | Text: 他感觉我要通过多久多久的时间
Segment #20  [00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:33,020] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 8  | Text: 我一定要找到多少的粉丝
Segment #21  [00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:34,640] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 8  | Text: 你们的出发点就错了
Segment #22  [00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:36,000] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 7  | Text: 先不要给自己生目标
Segment #23  [00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,240] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 6  | Text: 因为你的期望越大
Segment #24  [00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:38,040] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 时光就越大
Segment #25  [00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:39,440] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 8  | Text: 如果说你做一条视频
Segment #26  [00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:41,040] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 9  | Text: 你感觉有500个播放量
Segment #27  [00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:42,620] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 你第二天还是500
Segment #28  [00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:43,220] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 2  | Text: 第三天
Segment #29  [00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:44,320] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 7  | Text: 有可能你就不想拍了
Segment #30  [00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:45,140] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 3  | Text: 但是你要知道
Segment #31  [00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:47,120] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 9  | Text: 你一天有500个播放量
Segment #32  [00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:47,860] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 十天是多少
Segment #33  [00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:48,420] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 3  | Text: 是五千
Segment #34  [00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:49,900] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 一个月是多少
Segment #35  [00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,120] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 一个月是15万
Segment #36  [00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:52,220] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 从继亚来开始
Segment #37  [00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:52,980] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 你做到过年
Segment #38  [00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:54,320] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 6  | Text: 你三个月的时间
Segment #39  [00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:56,300] | Elapsed:  31.61s | Words: 11 | Text: 你会有四五十万的曝光量
Segment #40  [00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:57,340] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 3  | Text: 说明什么
Segment #41  [00:00:57,340 --> 00:00:58,920] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 9  | Text: 有四五十万人看过你
Segment #42  [00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:01,040] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 9  | Text: 哪怕你拍的乱七八糟
Segment #43  [00:01:01,040 --> 00:01:02,320] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 5  | Text: 到过年为止
Segment #44  [00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:03,800] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 10 | Text: 你也有几十万人看过你
Segment #45  [00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:04,760] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 5  | Text: 看过你的产品
Segment #46  [00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:06,080] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 6  | Text: 那你为什么不拍呢
Segment #47  [00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,860] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 8  | Text: 窮人做不了自媒体的
Segment #48  [00:01:07,860 --> 00:01:08,900] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 6  | Text: 最主要的原因就是
Segment #49  [00:01:08,900 --> 00:01:10,200] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 6  | Text: 我在做的过程中
Segment #50  [00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:12,680] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 6  | Text: 我太迫切地去
Segment #51  [00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:14,560] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 5  | Text: 何妄赚到钱
Segment #52  [00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:16,300] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是逻辑你们高分了
Segment #53  [00:01:16,300 --> 00:01:17,560] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 5  | Text: 你们是在做事情
Segment #54  [00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:19,460] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 6  | Text: 你们只有把事情做好了
Segment #55  [00:01:19,460 --> 00:01:20,200] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 4  | Text: 钱才会来
Segment #56  [00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,840] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 8  | Text: 而且我这里面分享一个观点
Segment #57  [00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,520] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是决心的重要性
Segment #58  [00:01:23,520 --> 00:01:24,700] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 5  | Text: 决心和行动
Segment #59  [00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:25,620] | Elapsed:  48.17s | Words: 6  | Text: 你们感觉哪个重要
Segment #60  [00:01:25,620 --> 00:01:26,960] | Elapsed:  66.28s | Words: 6  | Text: 比如说拼乎钱的
Segment #61  [00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:27,860] | Elapsed:  66.28s | Words: 5  | Text: 你们问你们一个问题
Segment #62  [00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:29,400] | Elapsed:  66.28s | Words: 4  | Text: 现在让你把
Segment #63  [00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:30,860] | Elapsed:  66.28s | Words: 6  | Text: 道德金背下来
Segment #64  [00:01:30,860 --> 00:01:31,740] | Elapsed:  66.28s | Words: 6  | Text: 给你100万块钱
Segment #65  [00:01:31,740 --> 00:01:32,300] | Elapsed:  66.28s | Words: 4  | Text: 你会背吗
Segment #66  [00:01:32,300 --> 00:01:33,220] | Elapsed:  66.28s | Words: 3  | Text: 你一定会
Segment #67  [00:01:33,220 --> 00:01:34,240] | Elapsed:  66.28s | Words: 4  | Text: 你以为你知道
Segment #68  [00:01:34,240 --> 00:01:35,480] | Elapsed:  66.29s | Words: 9  | Text: 你把这个东西背完之后
Segment #69  [00:01:35,480 --> 00:01:36,800] | Elapsed:  66.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 你就有一百万块钱
Segment #70  [00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:37,900] | Elapsed:  66.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 那么我再问你
Segment #71  [00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:39,400] | Elapsed:  66.29s | Words: 8  | Text: 给你30万你会不会背
Segment #72  [00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:41,120] | Elapsed:  66.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 那可能很多人想一想
Segment #73  [00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:42,060] | Elapsed:  66.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 30万有点少
Segment #74  [00:01:42,060 --> 00:01:43,900] | Elapsed:  66.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 我这个太难了
Segment #75  [00:01:43,900 --> 00:01:44,940] | Elapsed:  66.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 我文化手工不高
Segment #76  [00:01:44,940 --> 00:01:45,740] | Elapsed:  66.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 我还是不背了
Segment #77  [00:01:45,740 --> 00:01:46,920] | Elapsed:  66.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是有一部分人
Segment #78  [00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,260] | Elapsed:  66.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 他也会去背
Segment #79  [00:01:48,260 --> 00:01:49,640] | Elapsed:  66.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是你们知不知道
Segment #80  [00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:51,140] | Elapsed:  66.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 互联网的总结
Segment #81  [00:01:51,140 --> 00:01:51,940] | Elapsed:  66.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是这个视频
Segment #82  [00:01:51,940 --> 00:01:53,220] | Elapsed:  66.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 给你们铺垫了这么久
Segment #83  [00:01:53,220 --> 00:01:54,480] | Elapsed:  66.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 希望你们能听懂
Segment #84  [00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:55,180] | Elapsed:  66.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 接下来的重点
Segment #85  [00:01:55,180 --> 00:01:57,340] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 8  | Text: 如果说一分钱不给你
Segment #86  [00:01:57,340 --> 00:01:59,660] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 9  | Text: 你真的把道德金背下来了
Segment #87  [00:01:59,660 --> 00:02:02,080] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 12 | Text: 然后根据你对于道德金的理解
Segment #88  [00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:03,800] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 11 | Text: 你对于历史的典故的拆解
Segment #89  [00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:05,100] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 7  | Text: 你去把所有的东西
Segment #90  [00:02:05,100 --> 00:02:05,960] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 5  | Text: 记录成视频
Segment #91  [00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:06,980] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 6  | Text: 发到互联网上
Segment #92  [00:02:06,980 --> 00:02:07,540] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 3  | Text: 你可能有
Segment #93  [00:02:07,540 --> 00:02:09,180] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 8  | Text: 拥有几十万的粉丝
Segment #94  [00:02:09,180 --> 00:02:10,420] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 5  | Text: 你有专业以后
Segment #95  [00:02:10,420 --> 00:02:11,740] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 8  | Text: 你在不断的输出内容
Segment #96  [00:02:11,740 --> 00:02:12,700] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 5  | Text: 获得了更多
Segment #97  [00:02:12,700 --> 00:02:14,500] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 9  | Text: 喜欢你认可你的粉丝以后
Segment #98  [00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:15,760] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 8  | Text: 你赚到的钱要远远
Segment #99  [00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:16,520] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 4  | Text: 大于100万
Segment #100 [00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:17,820] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 7  | Text: 有可能是200万 300万
Segment #101 [00:02:17,820 --> 00:02:19,840] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 11 | Text: 这又是决心和行动的区别
Segment #102 [00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:21,160] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 6  | Text: 你们太多人是因为
Segment #103 [00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:22,840] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 8  | Text: 前面那个钱值的誘因
Segment #104 [00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:23,780] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 3  | Text: 因为100万
Segment #105 [00:02:23,780 --> 00:02:24,600] | Elapsed:  85.43s | Words: 6  | Text: 会去做一件事
